ption><option value="ECH:WWTTS-4">ECH:WWTTS-4</option><option value="ECH:WWTTS-5">ECH:WWTTS-5</option><option value="ECH:WWTTS-6">ECH:WWTTS-6</option><option value="ECH:WWTTS-7">ECH:WWTTS-7</option><option value="ECH:WWTTS-8">ECH:WWTTS-8</option><option value="ECH:WWTTS-9">ECH:WWTTS-9</option><option value="ECH:WYCnc">ECH:WYCnc</option><option value="ECH:WZOph">ECH:WZOph</option><option value="ECH:XARI">ECH:XARI</option><option value="ECH:X-Crt">ECH:X-Crt</option><option value="ECH:XCYG">ECH:XCYG</option><option value="ECH:XXAND">ECH:XXAND</option><option value="ECH:XZCYG">ECH:XZCYG</option><option value="ECH:XZDRA">ECH:XZDRA</option><option value="ECH:YYGem">ECH:YYGem</option><option value="ECH:YYHER">ECH:YYHER</option><option value="ECH:YYSGR">ECH:YYSGR</option><option value="ECH:ZAnd">ECH:ZAnd</option><option value="ECH:ZETGEM">ECH:ZETGEM</option><option value="ECH:ZLAC">ECH:ZLAC</option><option value="ECH:Z-Mic">ECH:Z-Mic</option><option value="ECH:ZZUMa">ECH:ZZUMa</option></select> <span class="fieldlegend">No selection matches all, multiple values legal.</span></span></div><div class="description">Somewhat cleaned name of the target object as given in the file. The names should either be SIMBAD-resolvable or give a reference for the source. Some names we could not make sense of are marked with a tilda (~); any help figuring out what they are is appreciated.</div></div><div id="genForm-pos_ssa_location-field" class="field string textinput"><label class="label" for="genForm-pos_ssa_location">Location</label><div class="inputs"><input type="text" name="pos_ssa_location" id="genForm-pos_ssa_location"></div><div class="description">Coordinates (as h m s, d m s or decimal degrees), or SIMBAD-resolvable object</div></div><div id="genForm-sr_ssa_location-field" class="field float textinput"><label class="label" for="genForm-sr_ssa_location">Search radius for Location [arcmin]</label><div class="inputs"><input type="text" name="sr_ssa_location" id="genForm-sr_ssa_location"></div><div class="description">Search radius in arcminutes</div></div><div id="genForm-ssa_dateObs-field" class="field string dateexpressionfield"><label class="label" for="genForm-ssa_dateObs">Date Obs.</label><div class="inputs"><span style="white-space:nowrap"><input type="text" name="ssa_dateObs" id="genForm-ssa_dateObs"> <span class="fieldlegend"><a href="/static/help_vizier.shtml#dates">[?date expr.]</a></span></span></div><div class="description">Midpoint of exposure (MJD)</div></div><div id="genForm-ssa_redshift-field" class="field string numericexpressionfield"><label class="label" for="genForm-ssa_redshift">z</label><div class="inputs"><span style="white-space:nowrap"><input type="text" name="ssa_redshift" id="genForm-ssa_redshift"> <span class="fieldlegend"><a href="/static/help_vizier.shtml#floats">[?num. expr.]</a></span></span></div><div class="description">Redshift of target object</div></div><div id="genForm-ssa_snr-field" class="field string numericexpressionfield"><label class="label" for="genForm-ssa_snr">SNR</label><div class="inputs"><span style="white-space:nowrap"><input type="text" name="ssa_snr" id="genForm-ssa_snr"> <span class="fieldlegend"><a href="/static/help_vizier.shtml#floats">[?num. expr.]</a></span></span></div><div class="description">Signal-to-noise ratio estimated for this dataset</div></div><div id="genForm-ssa_specmid-field" class="field string numericexpressionfield"><label class="label" for="genForm-ssa_specmid">Mid. Band [m]</label><div class="inputs"><span style="white-space:nowrap"><input type="text" name="ssa_specmid" id="genForm-ssa_specmid"> <span class="fieldlegend"><a href="/static/help_vizier.shtml#floats">[?num. expr.]</a></span></span></div><div class="description">Midpoint of region covered in this dataset</div></div><div id="genForm-ssa_specstart-field" class="field string numericexpressionfield"><label class="label" for="genForm-ssa_specstart">Band start [m]</label><div class="inputs"><span style="white-space:nowrap"><input type="text" name="ssa_specstart" id="genForm-ssa_specstart"> <span class="fieldlegend"><a href="/static/help_vizier.shtml#floats">[?num. expr.]</a></span></span></div><div class="description">Lower value of spectral coordinate</div></div><div id="genForm-ssa_specend-field" class="field string numericexpressionfield"><label class="label" for="genForm-ssa_specend">Band end [m]</label><div class="inputs"><span style="white-space:nowrap"><input type="text" name="ssa_specend" id="genForm-ssa_specend"> <span class="fieldlegend"><a href="/static/help_vizier.shtml#floats">[?num. expr.]</a></span></span></div><div class="description">Upper value of spectral coordinate</div></div><div id="genForm-mime-field" class="field string checkboxmultichoice"><label class="label" for="genForm-mime">Type</label><div class="inputs"><span class="nobreak"><input type="checkbox" name="mime" value="image/fits" id="genForm-mime-0-box" class="multichoice" onchange="Forms.Util.updateLabel(this)"><span class="multichoice" id="genForm-mime-0-label" onclick="Forms.Util.labelClick(this)">1D FITS image</span></span><br></div><div class="description">MIME type of the file served</div></div><div id="genForm-upload-field" class="field file fileupload"><label class="label" for="genForm-upload">Upload</label><div class="inputs"><input name="upload" id="genForm-upload" type="file"></div><div class="description">Upload a list of target positions; this expects a text file with three floats per line (ICRS RA, Dec, radius, coordinates in degrees, radii in arcsec).</div></div><div id="genForm-_DBOPTIONS-field" class="field type dboptions required"><label class="label" for="genForm-_DBOPTIONS">Table</label><div class="inputs"><span id="genForm-_DBOPTIONS">Sort by <select name="_DBOPTIONS_ORDER" id="genForm-_DBOPTIONS_ORDER"><option value="" selected="selected"></option><option value="location_ra">RA</option><option value="location_dec">Dec</option><option value="accref">Product key</option><option value="mime">Type</option><option value="accsize">File size</option><option value="ssa_creatorDID">Creator DataID</option><option value="journal_ref">Bibliography</option><option value="ssa_bandpass">Bandpass</option><option value="ssa_targname">Target Name</option><option value="ssa_aperture">Aperture</option><option value="ssa_dateObs">Date Obs.</option><option value="ssa_timeExt">Exp. Time</option><option value="ssa_specmid">Mid. Band</option><option value="ssa_specext">Bandwidth</option><option value="ssa_specstart">Band start</option><option value="ssa_specend">Band end</option><option value="ssa_location">Location</option></select>  <select name="_DBOPTIONS_DIR" id="genForm-_DBOPTIONS_DIR"><option value="ASC">ASC</option><option value="DESC">DESC</option></select><br>Limit to <select name="MAXREC" id="genForm-MAXREC"><option value="100" selected="selected">100</option><option value="1000">1000</option><option value="5000">5000</option><option value="10000">10000</option><option value="100000">100000</option><option value="250000">250000</option></select> items.</span></div><div class="description"></div></div><div id="genForm-_OUTPUT-field" class="field type outputformat required"><label class="label" for="genForm-_OUTPUT">Output format</label><div class="inputs"><div id="genForm-_OUTPUT" style="position:relative"><select name="_FORMAT" id="genForm-_FORMAT" onchange="output_broadcast(this.value)"><option value="HTML" selected="selected">HTML</option><option value="VOTable">VOTable</option><option value="FITS">FITS table</option><option value="TSV">Text (with Tabs)</option><option value="txt">Text (fixed columns)</option><option value="CSV">CSV</option><option value="JSON">JSON</option><option value="tar">tar</option></select><div title="Additional output column selector" id="genForm-_ADDITEMS" style="display:none"><table id="addSelection"><tr><td><input type="checkbox" name="_ADDITEM" value="embargo" style="width:auto"></td><td style="vertical-align:middle"> embargo -- Date the data will become/became public</td></tr><tr><td><input type="checkbox" name="_ADDITEM" value="owner" style="width:auto"></td><td style="vertical-align:middle"> owner -- Owner of the data</td></tr><tr><td><input type="checkbox" name="_ADDITEM" value="ssa_cdate" style="width:auto"></td><td style="vertical-align:middle"> ssa_cdate -- Processing/Creation date</td></tr><tr><td><input type="checkbox" name="_ADDITEM" value="ssa_cversion" style="width:auto"></td><td style="vertical-align:middle"> ssa_cversion -- Creator assigned version for this dataset (will be incremented when this particular item is changed).</td></tr><tr><td><input type="checkbox" name="_ADDITEM" value="ssa_dstitle" style="width:auto"></td><td style="vertical-align:middle"> ssa_dstitle -- A compact and descriptive designation of the dataset.</td></tr><tr><td><input type="checkbox" name="_ADDITEM" value="ssa_length" style="width:auto"></td><td style="vertical-align:middle"> ssa_length -- Number of points in the spectrum</td></tr><tr><td><input type="checkbox" name="_ADDITEM" value="ssa_pdate" style="width:auto"></td><td style="vertical-align:middle"> ssa_pdate -- Date last published.</td></tr><tr><td><input type="checkbox" name="_ADDITEM" value="ssa_pubDID" style="width:auto"></td><td style="vertical-align:middle"> ssa_pubDID -- Dataset identifier assigned by the publisher</td></tr><tr><td><input type="checkbox" name="_ADDITEM" value="ssa_redshift" style="width:auto"></td><td style="vertical-align:middle"> ssa_redshift -- Redshift of target object</td></tr><tr><td><input type="checkbox" name="_ADDITEM" value="ssa_snr" style="width:auto"></td><td style="vertical-align:middle"> ssa_snr -- Signal-to-noise ratio estimated for this dataset</td></tr><tr><td><input type="checkbox" name="_ADDITEM" value="ssa_targclass" style="width:auto"></td><td style="vertical-align:middle"> ssa_targclass -- Object class (star, QSO,...; use Simbad object classification http://simbad.u-strasbg.fr/simbad/sim-display?data=otypes if at all possible)</td></tr><tr><td><input type="checkbox" name="_ADDITEM" value="ssa_targetpos" style="width:auto"></td><td style="vertical-align:middle"> ssa_targetpos -- Equatorial (ICRS) position of the target object.</td></tr></table></div></div></div><div class="description"></div></div><div class="actions"><input type="submit" id="genForm-action-submit" name="submit" value="Go"><div class="formLinks"> <a href="" class="resultlink" onmouseover="this.href=makeBookmarkLink(getEnclosingForm(this))"><img src="/static/img/bookmark.png" class="silentlink" title="Link to this form" alt="[bookmark]"></a></div></div></div></form>
